config BR2_PACKAGE_FOURREEL_STEREO
	bool "4reel stereo ZipDepth development pipeline"
	depends on BR2_ARM_CPU_HAS_NEON
	help
	  Native triggered calibration capture and genuine RV1103 ZipDepth,
	  with per-unit DS geometry and bounded CPU sparse stereo.
	  Requires the verified local bundle described in STEREO_ZIPDEPTH.md.
	  Hardware validation is still required; no factory calibration included.
